  "description": "零配置：自动给第三方模型补上思考档位（默认 DeepSeek 同款 off/low/high/max），模型选择器即出现 Effort 菜单",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
